# ==============================================================================
# AI / LLM Configuration (SECURITY NOTICE)
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: GROQ_API_KEY is NEVER exposed in the frontend bundle or client .env files.
# It is configured securely in Supabase Edge Functions environment:
#
# Deploy & Set Secret:
#   supabase secrets set GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
#   supabase secrets set GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#   supabase functions deploy ai-assistant --no-verify-jwt
# ==============================================================================
